first_time_dialogue = "Some stones are part of the cavern.
Others are only waiting for a strong enough hand.

Loose rocks can be pushed aside.
Stand near this one and press E to move it.

After the rock is out of your way, come to me."
active_dialogue = "Push the loose rock out of the way, then come to me."
ready_to_turn_in_dialogue = "Good. You noticed the difference.

Not every obstacle must be broken.
Some only need to be moved."
completed_dialogue = "You have already learned how to move loose rocks."
summary = "The Echo Spirit wants me to push a loose rock out of the way."
objective_text = "Push the loose rock, then return to the Echo Spirit."
